 has also drawn substantial outside support, and Republican groups have spent to boost her while opposing spending has been modest.\n\nA single September poll showed Mealer ahead by six points, and prediction markets put Republican chances near 80%. Most expert raters call the race Likely Republican, with a couple rating it Solid or Safe. The forecast expects a Republican win by roughly eight points, with enough uncertainty that a strong Democratic environment or late spending shift could tighten the race.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0912, "margin": -8.44}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0891, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0766, "margin": -10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.1178, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0737, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0642, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0775, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.0899, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0901, "margin": -9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0919, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.1301, "margin": -7.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.1157, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.1517, "margin": -7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0916, "margin": -8.0}]}